OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSkies turn
OL,6,Fcloudier from the east overnight, with
OL,7,Fperhaps the odd light shower. Chillier
OL,8,Funder clearer skies further west, with
OL,9,Fa touch of frost and mist and fog in
OL,10,Fplaces.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FPatchy cloud with sunny
OL,13,Fspells throughout the day on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fwith perhaps the odd light shower
OL,15,Ffirst thing. Temperatures, around
OL,16,Faverage and feeling similar to Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
