OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry and settled over
OL,7,Fthe next few days, with sunny spells.
OL,8,FBreezier on Wednesday, making it feel
OL,9,Frather chilly despite temperatures
OL,10,Fremaining close to average.
